# The Body behind a ParameterGuard believes what the guard tested. Only the build's verifier held a call of the Body to that; under the words on proofs the Body took `tested` as told, and under CheckProofsAtEntries
# it was not asked at all, since the fused entry lies in front of the guard.
# THE LIE: testing=RowSaysLess:Callee/f1/TestsOfGuard: the emitter lets every test of the guard of f1 pass; the walk, the judge of calls and Validate see a right guard. Two texts in boxes of `undefined|number` compare equal.
